{{!-- A centred page opener: accent eyebrow, oversized headline, standfirst.

	{{> "centered-intro" eyebrow=(t "About") headingId="a1-h"}}                       About's
	{{> "centered-intro" eyebrow=(t "Membership") headingId="m1-h" padding="pt-22 pb-14"
	    titleClass="max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(36px,5vw,62px)]" titleSpacing="mt-6"
	    descriptionClass="text-lead mt-[22px] max-w-[52ch] leading-[1.55]"}}          Membership's

	eyebrow            the theme's word for what kind of Surface this is
	headingId          the h1's id, so the section can be labelled by it
	padding            section padding — 96/72 on About, 88/56 on Membership
	titleClass         headline size and measure
	titleSpacing       space above the headline — 26px on About, 24px on Membership
	descriptionClass   standfirst face and measure — italic body on About, the lead size on Membership

Called from inside {{#post}}, so the page is the context. Distinct from page-intro.hbs, which is
the directories' left-aligned opener; this one is the statement the two standing Pages lead with,
and the design draws them differently enough that one partial with six arguments would be less
readable than two.

Title and standfirst are the publication's, read off the page record — see page-intro.hbs for why
the lead is `{{excerpt}}` and not `{{content}}`. The editor's per-page toggle owns the whole
opener. --}}
{{#if @page.show_title_and_feature_image}}
	<section
		aria-labelledby="{{headingId}}"
		style="--container-max:1120px"
		class="container text-center {{#if padding}}{{padding}}{{else}}pt-24 pb-18{{/if}}">
		<p class="font-meta text-meta text-accent tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">{{eyebrow}}</p>

		<h1
			id="{{headingId}}"
			class="font-display tracking-display mx-auto leading-[1.04] font-medium text-balance {{#if titleSpacing}}{{titleSpacing}}{{else}}mt-[26px]{{/if}} {{#if titleClass}}{{titleClass}}{{else}}max-w-[20ch] text-[clamp(38px,5.4vw,68px)]{{/if}}">{{title}}</h1>

		{{#if excerpt}}
			<p
				class="text-muted mx-auto text-pretty {{#if descriptionClass}}{{descriptionClass}}{{else}}font-body mt-6 max-w-[54ch] text-[22px] leading-[1.5] italic{{/if}}">{{excerpt}}</p>
		{{/if}}
	</section>
{{/if}}
